  "details": "Description\n\nFor the last few weeks, my PC VRChat has been having serveral issues sending and receiving Invite and Join Requests, in addition to slow video player loading. This has been going on for the last few weeks and I have been wondering if this may be an issue with my system or the VRC. Videos will eventually load after an extended period of time, but I have been unable to see new invites.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nAttempting to play a new video upon joining a world causes a long delay in the video player. Waiting for an extended period of time will make it eventually load.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1-1933-204f027ae8-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-16_17-04-54.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_f20069ad-540f-40fe-8eed-664a45036c5e/1/file)",
